{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>And Elazar.</b> He mentioned Elazar's wife for the honor of Pinchas, for to him the priesthood was given forever. Therefore, by logical reasoning, Putiel was from the children of Israel, and we do not know the reason for Putiel, just as we do not know the reason for Mishael, and all the names mentioned such as Aaron — had the deed of Moses not been written, we would not have known why he was so called:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:12.337782734Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}